## S08 冒烟测试应用（列表/对话框/输入行渲染 + QMP 按键自检；仅 QEMU 冒烟用）
[Defines]
  INF_VERSION    = 0x0001001b
  BASE_NAME      = TuiWidgetTest
  FILE_GUID      = 7C9E4A12-3B8D-4E6F-9A51-D28F6E40B3C7
  MODULE_TYPE    = UEFI_APPLICATION
  VERSION_STRING = 1.0
  ENTRY_POINT    = UefiMain

[Sources]
  TuiWidgetTest.c

[Packages]
  MdePkg/MdePkg.dec
  EasyEfiPkg/EasyEfiPkg.dec

[LibraryClasses]
  UefiApplicationEntryPoint
  UefiLib
  UefiBootServicesTableLib
  PrintLib
  TuiWidgetLib
  TuiScreenLib
  TuiInputLib

[BuildOptions]
  GCC:*_*_*_CC_FLAGS = -DUEFI_BUILD
